    "in `planFind.ts` line 371 `[\"plan-find\", vaultId]` is `planFindVaultKey(vaultId)`; in `planSearch.ts` line 26 `[\"plan-search\", planVault]` is `planSearchKey(planVault)`; the new file `cacheKeys.ts` is the one definition of `STAKEHOLDER_SEARCH_AUTHORITY_KEY`, `planSearchKey` and `planFindVaultKey` (later sites: `PlanStakeholders.tsx:920`, `PlanFunctionForm.tsx:1468`, `PlanDescriptionParts.tsx:997`, `PlanTagLinks.tsx:58`)",
    "in `partyName.ts` line 33 the text of the field `source` of `PARTY_NAME_FLOOR` (a host and an internal ruling name) is reworded; no code reads the field",
